## 🚀 Quick Start

### Prerequisites

Make sure you have these installed:

| Tool | Version | Check Command |
|------|---------|---------------|
| Python | 3.10+ | `python --version` |
| Node.js | 18+ | `node --version` |
| npm | 9+ | `npm --version` |
| Git | Latest | `git --version` |

---

### 1️⃣ Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/vishakha2121/autonomous-experiment-planner.git
cd autonomous-experiment-planner
2️⃣ Get Gemini API Key (FREE)
Visit Google AI Studio

Sign in with Google account

Click "Create API Key"

Copy the key (looks like: AIzaSy...)

3️⃣ Backend Setup
bash
# Navigate to backend
cd backend

# Create virtual environment
python -m venv venv

# Activate it
# Windows:
venv\Scripts\activate
# Mac/Linux:
source venv/bin/activate

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Create .env file
copy .env.example .env      # Windows
cp .env.example .env        # Mac/Linux
Edit .env file and add your API key:

env
GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy...your_key_here
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./app.db
SECRET_KEY=your_random_secret_key_here
DEBUG=True
Initialize database & run server:

bash
python -m app.db.init_db
uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
✅ Backend running at: http://localhost:8000
📚 API Docs at: http://localhost:8000/docs

4️⃣ Frontend Setup
Open a new terminal:

bash
# Navigate to frontend
cd frontend

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Create .env file
copy .env.example .env      # Windows
cp .env.example .env        # Mac/Linux
Edit .env:

env
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
Start dev server:

bash
npm run dev
✅ Frontend running at: http://localhost:5173

5️⃣ Database Setup (Optional - if using PostgreSQL)
bash
cd database
psql -U postgres -f schema.sql
psql -U postgres -f seed.sql
🔑 Environment Variables
Backend (backend/.env)
Variable	Description	Example
GEMINI_API_KEY	Google Gemini API key	AIzaSy...
DATABASE_URL	Database connection string	sqlite:///./app.db
SECRET_KEY	JWT secret key	random-32-char-string
ALGORITHM	JWT algorithm	HS256
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES	Token expiry	1440
DEBUG	Debug mode	True
Frontend (frontend/.env)
Variable	Description	Example
VITE_API_URL	Backend API URL	http://localhost:8000/api
