📄 .gitignore File - Complete Setup
🎯 Kya Hota Hai .gitignore?
.gitignore file Git ko batati hai kaun-kaun si files/folders GitHub pe push NAHI karne hain. Ye important hai kyunki:

❌ venv/, node_modules/ — bahut bade hote hain, upload nahi karne

❌ .env — secret API keys hoti hain, kabhi push nahi karna

❌ *.db, *.log — local data files

❌ IDE settings — personal preferences

